	(descr "Fiducial, 1mm bare copper circle with a 2mm soldermask opening, IPC-7351 Level A. The standard global fiducial for JLCPCB and any other SMT house. No paste aperture, paste would kill the contrast the placement camera needs. Place at least three per assembly side, asymmetrically so orientation is unambiguous, and keep 5mm clear of the board edge.")
